          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Heightened US‑Iran kinetic engagement consumes US and allied munitions, logistics capacity, and ready-stock inventories, forcing suppliers to delay or reduce weapons shipments to Ukraine and thereby lowering arms transfer volume to that war." />
