          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Increases in Iran‑related shipping incidents and insurance/route disruptions raise logistics, contractual and security uncertainty for crude exports, prompting investors to mark up political and operational risk for Venezuelan oil investments." />
