          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Concentration of critical comms, satellite and cloud infrastructure under US-aligned providers lets US forces integrate ISR, targeting and naval C2 more rapidly, improving their ability to interdict or deny traffic through key maritime chokepoints." />
