          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A sustained increase in Venezuelan crude production and exports depresses global oil prices, reducing Russia's hydrocarbon revenue and thereby constraining budgetary resources available for domestic missile manufacturing, lowering missile output over time." />
