          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A spike in market-implied volatility raises war‑risk and freight insurance premia and prompts shipowners and charterers to reroute, delay or idle voyages through high-risk stretches, directly increasing the rate of commercial shipping disruptions in the Gulf and nearby corridors." />
